    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a HeartsLike action-RPG inspired by 1001 Arabian Nights.<br>Step into the shoes of Faris, a young boy who finds himself in an unfamiliar world, the mystical city of Noor. With darkness shrouding the city and the evil Masked King reigning supreme, Faris must restore light and hope. Battle dark creatures, unlock hidden abilities, and rally allies to stop the Masked King and find a way back home. Along the way, encounter memorable characters who will join your quest and help you navigate the vibrant and treacherous landscapes of Noor.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/8f31218b0d75a78de812a84858b2265b.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/8f31218b0d75a78de812a84858b2265b.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/8f31218b0d75a78de812a84858b2265b.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging Action-RPG Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fast-paced, real-time combat with a variety of weapons and abilities, dynamically switching forms to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/bf3e815e6221d5e7e019f980850056b6.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/bf3e815e6221d5e7e019f980850056b6.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/bf3e815e6221d5e7e019f980850056b6.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3D Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master thrilling 3D platforming challenges as you navigate the diverse terrains of Noor city, from rooftops to underground tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/cccc46c77e4bcc5e86d9c46943b9cc32.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/cccc46c77e4bcc5e86d9c46943b9cc32.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/cccc46c77e4bcc5e86d9c46943b9cc32.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize Faris's abilities and weapons as you progress, unlocking powerful upgrades and new skills to aid in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/f5f6cd9745b8760b84a26b04a4cb9718.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/f5f6cd9745b8760b84a26b04a4cb9718.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/f5f6cd9745b8760b84a26b04a4cb9718.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Memorable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a diverse cast of characters, each with their own backstories and struggles. Help them overcome their pasts and join your fight against the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/280171880e88e90d60eeeb703c98c87e.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/280171880e88e90d60eeeb703c98c87e.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/280171880e88e90d60eeeb703c98c87e.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vibrant Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the richly detailed and culturally inspired city of Noor, filled with vibrant markets, hidden alleys, and grand palaces.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a HeartsLike action-RPG inspired by 1001 Arabian Nights.<br>Step into the shoes of Faris, a young boy who finds himself in an unfamiliar world, the mystical city of Noor. With darkness shrouding the city and the evil Masked King reigning supreme, Faris must restore light and hope. Battle dark creatures, unlock hidden abilities, and rally allies to stop the Masked King and find a way back home. Along the way, encounter memorable characters who will join your quest and help you navigate the vibrant and treacherous landscapes of Noor.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/8f31218b0d75a78de812a84858b2265b.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/8f31218b0d75a78de812a84858b2265b.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/8f31218b0d75a78de812a84858b2265b.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging Action-RPG Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fast-paced, real-time combat with a variety of weapons and abilities, dynamically switching forms to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/bf3e815e6221d5e7e019f980850056b6.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/bf3e815e6221d5e7e019f980850056b6.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/bf3e815e6221d5e7e019f980850056b6.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3D Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master thrilling 3D platforming challenges as you navigate the diverse terrains of Noor city, from rooftops to underground tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/cccc46c77e4bcc5e86d9c46943b9cc32.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/cccc46c77e4bcc5e86d9c46943b9cc32.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/cccc46c77e4bcc5e86d9c46943b9cc32.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize Faris's abilities and weapons as you progress, unlocking powerful upgrades and new skills to aid in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/f5f6cd9745b8760b84a26b04a4cb9718.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/f5f6cd9745b8760b84a26b04a4cb9718.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/f5f6cd9745b8760b84a26b04a4cb9718.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Memorable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a diverse cast of characters, each with their own backstories and struggles. Help them overcome their pasts and join your fight against the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/280171880e88e90d60eeeb703c98c87e.poster.avif?t=1750723809\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/280171880e88e90d60eeeb703c98c87e.webm?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949610/extras/280171880e88e90d60eeeb703c98c87e.mp4?t=1750723809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vibrant Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the richly detailed and culturally inspired city of Noor, filled with vibrant markets, hidden alleys, and grand palaces.</p>",
